tional well-being, cultivate self-awareness, compassion, gratitude, and altruism.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1100"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" marR="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="900"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="1400"/><a:buFont typeface="Times"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>Through interactive games, life simulations, role-playing, guided reflection, and group activities, participants explore their inner selves, recognize emotional patterns, overcome limiting beliefs, and develop healthier relationships and a more positive outlook on life.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1100"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" marR="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="900"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="1400"/><a:buFont typeface="Times"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>The three progressive levels guide participants toward greater emotional resilience, personal growth, inner peace, and a deeper understanding of themselves and others.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1100"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" marR="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="900"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="1400"/><a:buFont typeface="Times"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="1" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>Open to everyone regardless of religious or cultural background</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>, the retreats encourage full participation in an inclusive and supportive environment.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1100"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" marR="0" rtl="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="900"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="1400"/><a:buFont typeface="Times"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="1" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>Completely free and nonprofit</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr b="0" i="0" lang="en-CA" spc="0" sz="1400" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="778749"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times"/><a:ea typeface="Times"/><a:cs typeface="Times"/><a:sym typeface="Times"/></a:rPr><a:t>, the programs provide all instruction, accommodation, and meals at no cost to participants, promoting individual well-being and healthier, more compassionate communities.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr sz="1100"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="logo - U.S. rec black.png" id="452" name="Google Shape;452;p33"/><p:cNvPi